  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.163",
   "en": "You can report quests in the Quest Room at the base."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.166",
   "en": "Our other unit in Shocker Cube found a mystery key but lost it in a fierce battle. Investigate the site."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.168",
   "en": "We've been waiting for you. Let's get right to our request."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.169",
   "en": "We of the Maganac Corps have been carrying out an investigation here, inside Shocker Cube."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.170",
   "en": "And in the course of that investigation, we found a mysterious key."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.171",
   "en": "A key? A key to what?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.172",
   "en": "Yes. Our investigation revealed that it's the key to one of the exhibit rooms here in Shocker Cube."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.173",
   "en": "We're told an old sword is on display inside."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.176",
   "en": "A sword!? Don't tell me that sword is on display here!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.177",
   "en": "Hey, when you go to that room, you're taking me with you."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.178",
   "en": "Is something on your mind?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.179",
   "en": "If I use that sword, I might be able to get my lost power back."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.180",
   "en": "I'm counting on you."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.181",
   "en": "Can't be helped. But first we've gotta find the key."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.182",
   "en": "Do you have any idea where you dropped the key?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.183",
   "en": "Yes. We were fighting in an open area at the bottom of a pitfall."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.184",
   "en": "I remember light leaking through the cracks in a nearby wall."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.185",
   "en": "I see. With that much to go on, we should be able to manage."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.186",
   "en": "Sorry for the trouble. We're counting on you."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.189",
   "en": "A sword? Couldn't God Gundam use it?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess018.mbb#0.190",
   "en": "Then I guess we'll take God Gundam along when we go to the room."
